# suspend_resume_bad_fifos: rvg_device_did_resume restores only child FIFO nodes whose running word (+0xe) is nonzero. Nodes 1 and 2 hold what would fail (node 1 a stamp index of 100, past the device's 64 FIFOs; node 2 a page list page outside guest RAM) but have running 0, so the resume never tries them and waking them does nothing. suspend_gap_resume_child_nodes locks the same nodes with running 1.
